In Real time time we are going to use is PV & PVC

what is meant by PV & PVC ?

PV ----------> Persistance Volume
PVC ---------> Persistance Volume Claim

we can't attach PV to a POd directly

go to aws Dashboard ---------> select volumes------> create volume ----> 10 gb ----> add tags ------> name:k8's-data --------> create volume

select created volume & copy the volume ID


vim pv.yml

---
apiVersion: v1
kind: PersistentVolume
metadata:
  name: pv-1
spec:
  storageClassName: manual
  capacity:
    storage: 2Gi
  accessModes:
    - ReadwriteOnce:
  persistancevolumeReclaimPolicy: Recycle
  awsElasticBlockStore:
    volumeID: vol-(copy & paste here volume ID)
    fsType: ext4

